 "marketingDescription": "<p><strong>The Crossroads Shopping Center</strong> is York’s most strategically located big box retail destination—positioned directly on Route 30 at the intersection of I-83, with 66,000+ vehicles passing daily.​ Anchored by national brands like Old Navy, PetSmart, Sprouts, and Interiors Home, the center sits at the heart of the regional trade area, drawing consistent traffic from both commuters and local shoppers.​</p><p>With five points of access from Route 30 and recent renovations completed, Crossroads offers prime visibility, strong co-tenancy, and seamless convenience for customers.​ Whether you’re a national retailer or a growing regional concept, Crossroads gives you the reach and foot traffic to scale.​ Surround yourself with top-performing brands in a high-growth corridor that captures shoppers from across the greater York market.​</p><p><strong>Now leasing.​</strong> Join a high-performing lineup in York’s most connected retail center.​</p>",
